+| DELETE | `/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` | offboard a user → 204 |
+
+`DELETE /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` is for org admins of that org only (other members → 403,
+other orgs → 404, user not in the org → 404). It removes the user from every project of the
+org, archived ones included, and revokes their org-admin flag. It is idempotent. Tasks
+already assigned to the user are left as they are.
